rvice?","a":"Yes. The Growth plan includes 4 SEO-optimized articles per month. Enterprise includes unlimited content. We research keywords, write the content, add structured data, and publish — you review and approve before anything goes live."},{"q":"Can you rank a business that is brand new?","a":"Yes — especially for local SEO (Google Business Profile, local pack) and long-tail queries. New sites take longer for competitive head terms, but our 90-day blueprint is specifically designed to build momentum quickly without waiting for domain age."},{"q":"Do you work with businesses outside India?","a":"Yes. While our team is based in Chennai, we manage SEO campaigns for clients in the UAE, UK, USA, and Southeast Asia. Our GEO strategies are particularly valuable for international markets where AI search adoption is highest."}]}]}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"border-t border-white/[0.06] px-5 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-24","style":{"background":"#060B17"},"children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.08] p-8 sm:p-12","style":{"background":"#0F1C32"},"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"section-label mx-auto mb-5 w-fit","children":"Ready to Rank?"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-[24px] font-black text-white sm:text-[32px]","children":"Get Your Free SEO + AI Visibility Audit"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mx-auto mt-4 max-w-lg text-[14px] leading-7 text-slate-400","children":"We'll audit your current search rankings, identify your biggest opportunities, and show you exactly where your brand stands in ChatGPT, Gemini, and Perplexity — completely free."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/demo","className":"btn-primary w-full sm:w-auto","children":"Get Free Audit →"}],["$","a",null,{"href":"https://wa.me/919943907643","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferre